=== Prompt ===
Who is Samus Aran?

=== Response ===
Samus Aran is the main protagonist of the Metroid video game series developed by Nintendo. She is a bounty hunter who wears a power suit to fight against alien creatures, particularly the Space Pirates and their leader, Ridley, as well as the deadly and parasitic creatures known as Metroids.

Samus was created by Gunpei Yokoi and first appeared in the 1986 game "Metroid" for the Nintendo Entertainment System (NES). She has since become a popular and iconic character in the world of gaming, known for her bravery, skill, and determination.

Throughout the series, Samus has battled against various threats, including the Space Pirates, who seek to harness the power of the Metroids for their own gain. Along the way, she has discovered her own past and the secrets of her power suit, which is a vital part of her identity.

Samus's character has been praised for her strength, independence, and complexity, making her a beloved character in the world of gaming.

